      "wasDerivedFrom": "paper",
      "context": {
        "prefix": "To compensate for the limited data for the NER from speech task, DS2 weights are used as a starting point to train the E2E model. We train a standard DS2 architecture on the DATA1 as a baseline. This system achieves a word error rate (WER) of 2.72% on the test set with a 4-gram LM and beam-width equal to",
        "suffix": "."
